# Local configuration template. Never commit real credentials.
# D1 DB, R2 MEDIA and Worker Loader LOADER bindings are in wrangler.jsonc.
# Use .dev.vars for local Worker secrets and `wrangler secret put` for deployment.
# Keep NODE_ENV unset here; Astro and the deployment runtime select the mode.
# NODE_ENV=production

# Optional application-specific secrets belong here only after the application
# is configured to consume them. Cloudflare Access protects the deployed URL
# through its Access policy; this template does not enable Access or admin auth.
